{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月10日，據路透社報道，一份公開聽證會通知顯示，<strong>SpaceX計劃在美國德克薩斯州星艦基地城建設一座燃氣發電廠和超級計算設施，項目初期階段預計資本投資約240億美元</strong>。相關設施將由SpaceX負責建設、持有和運營。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585750.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.116262+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:40:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"792fe84eb2ca6e9b0b07bc759030b73b7e8509cf6b764ff7f4499c3cfe62e3ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}